@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
[*] --> queued
queued --> running : 原子领取
running --> committing : 引擎完成并暂存
running --> failed : 超限、运行失败或恢复
committing --> succeeded : 结果与终态原子发布
committing --> failed : 回滚或恢复
failed --> [*]
succeeded --> [*]
note right of failed
重启保留 queued，遗留 running 或 committing 标记失败
重试创建新执行记录，保留原终态
end note
@enduml
